{"nodes": [{"id": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "label": "CI quality job (lint \u00b7 typecheck \u00b7 test \u00b7 build \u00b7 openapi)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs against a real postgres:16 service so the tenancy invariants cannot skip; BETTER_AUTH_SECRET is a throwaway because the schema forbids a dev fallback for a secret."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_android_job", "label": "CI android job (assembleDebug + JS bundle)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_ios_job", "label": "CI ios job (simulator build, macOS lane)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_migrations_append_only_check", "label": "CI check: applied migrations not modified, deleted or renamed", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_openapi_freshness_gate", "label": "CI OpenAPI freshness gate (pnpm check:openapi)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same script as local so CI and local can never diverge on what 'fresh' means; oasdiff is absent so only the freshness half gates the merge."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_i18n_extract_guard", "label": "CI i18n extract guard (unextracted messages never merge)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_build_before_boundaries", "label": "BUILD FIRST before lint/boundaries", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "dependency-cruiser resolves a workspace import through the target's main/types which point at dist/, so before anything is built the edge does not exist and every rule aimed at a dist-shipping package reports clean \u2014 proven 2026-07-31 with db-access-in-repositories-only."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_rn_bundle_step", "label": "CI RN JavaScript bundle step", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "assembleDebug does not bundle JS, so until this step a broken import path, renamed asset or package-exports change passed CI green; typecheck does not walk the real module graph, only the bundler does."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_xcodebuild_pipefail", "label": "shell: bash for pipefail on the xcodebuild lane", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without pipefail the step's exit status is tail's (always 0), so a Swift compile error, a missing Pod or a bad Info.plist produced a GREEN job and Law 7's only mechanical iOS proof could never fail."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_better_auth_migrate_step", "label": "CI Better Auth migrations step (7 plugin-owned tables)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without it the tenancy scan only WARNS the tables are absent, so the tables it exists to vet are never inspected in CI. Seven not eight: only organization and phoneNumber plugins are enabled, so jwks is not created."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_ci_secret_scan", "label": "CI gitleaks secret scan", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_build_before_boundaries", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_openapi_freshness_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_i18n_extract_guard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_migrations_append_only_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_better_auth_migrate_step", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_ci_quality_job", "target": "_github_workflows_ci_secret_scan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows